The **Snobbish Upperclassman** is top of her class, star of the kendo
team, and the most popular girl in school, and she's well aware of it.
Don't expect her to give you the time of day. *Agile +2, Beautiful +2,
Knowledge (Kendo) +2, Minions (Her Clique) +2, Quick +2, Smart +2;
Arrogant -2, Emotionless -1, Obsession (Meeting Her Mother's Lofty
Expectations) -2, Overconfident -2, Short-Tempered -1.*

